  "title": "Strawberry Avocado Salad",
  "description": "Strawberries and avocadoes sit atop mixed salad greens and are dressed with a honey vinaigrette dressing. I have served this countless times and I am always asked for the recipe, I also use this dressing on many other salads. Enjoy",
